      "created_at": "2015-01-26T18:53:22.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Ah, the old \"is a revealed card still in the deck\" issue...</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>![](upload://tCe7JWUFcDY8hhjLf1DhzzBJ1h.gif)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>To my knowledge, we don't have an official answer on this. I know there has been debates on other areas around if revealed cards area actually still in the deck or not, but I don't think there has ever been a consensus.</p><p>And... that none of that helps you. Except to let you know you aren't the only one who is wondering about this kind of thing. ![](upload://nchIGjrCD2ydeKFOxqHOVH9DOiO.gif)</p>",
