      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/killswitch/{size}/2116_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-01-26T19:25:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I would certainly say it leaves the deck, and it would form a stack of actions. That's how I would do it. So similarly how you would resolve multiple villian plays in order, you would move from one recompile to another in order, without keeping them in the deck. I'd just move both to the same play area as one-shots.</p>",
