      "created_at": "2015-01-26T19:58:38.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I think a revealed card is one that has left the deck but not landed anywhere else yet. It doesn't have a location. It's not in a deck. It's not &nbsp;in play. It's not in a hand. It's not in a trash. It is still in the game.</p>",
