      "created_at": "2015-01-26T20:47:25.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I guess the question would become: do you decide what to do with the second card after playing the first? I suppose in any case, as long as it's not in the deck, it shouldn't affect the second Recompile. It would just be nice to know when cards enter and exit \"limbo.\"</p>",
