      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/59ef9b/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2015-01-27T00:10:47.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I infer, from some things the devs have mentioned in response to my bug reports, that \"revealed\" is treated as a distinct location in the App, and a card that is there is not in the deck or anywhere else.</p>",
